# Default-deny repository context; the collector build copies only its component manifest.
*
!infra/
!infra/04.deploy/
!infra/04.deploy/03.product/
!infra/04.deploy/03.product/image/
!infra/04.deploy/03.product/image/core-server-persistence-observability-collector/
